# Terms & conditions (upgraded from Rubis module)
SLYCUSTOM_RUBIS_UPGRADE_DESC=This is the upgraded version of the original Rubis module. It appends Terms & conditions PDFs to order (and optionally invoice) PDFs. The options below match the original Rubis "Terms (CGV)" settings; you can upload, replace or delete default and per-language term files here.
SLYCUSTOM_CGV_SECTION=Terms & conditions
SLYCUSTOM_CGV_DESC=Upload PDF files to append as general terms to order (and optionally invoice) PDFs. Single file: documents/mycompany/terms/terms.pdf. With multi-language: documents/mycompany/terms/<lang>/terms.pdf (e.g. en_US, zh_CN).
SLYCUSTOM_CGV_OPTIONS_NOTE=Each row below corresponds to the original Rubis term files: "Default" = one PDF for all languages; "Terms for <lang>" = one PDF per language (e.g. Chinese, English). The correct file is appended to order/invoice PDFs based on the document language.
